WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.766
Every change your agents make shows up under Changes.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:09.337
Review the diff, file by file, before you keep it. And revert anything you don't want.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.083
Run your tests and builds from the Run menu. The results land right in the status bar.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.570
And Start dev server opens the running app, right inside LATYS.
